  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 6017,
      "text": "He will say, “Would that I had sent forth something for my [eternal] life!”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 89,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الفَجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Fajr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Dawn",
        "numberOfAyahs": 30,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 24,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 594,
      "ruku": 531,
      "hizbQuarter": 237,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6018,
      "text": "None can punish as He punishes on that Day,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 89,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الفَجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Fajr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Dawn",
        "numberOfAyahs": 30,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 25,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 594,
      "ruku": 531,
      "hizbQuarter": 237,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6019,
      "text": "and none can bind as He binds.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 89,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الفَجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Fajr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Dawn",
        "numberOfAyahs": 30,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 26,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 594,
      "ruku": 531,
      "hizbQuarter": 237,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6020,
      "text": "[It will be said to the believer,] “O the tranquil soul!",
      "surah": {
        "number": 89,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الفَجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Fajr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Dawn",
        "numberOfAyahs": 30,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 27,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 594,
      "ruku": 531,
      "hizbQuarter": 237,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6021,
      "text": "Return to your Lord, well pleased and pleasing [to Him].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 89,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الفَجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Fajr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Dawn",
        "numberOfAyahs": 30,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 28,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 594,
      "ruku": 531,
      "hizbQuarter": 237,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6022,
      "text": "Join My [righteous] slaves,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 89,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الفَجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Fajr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Dawn",
        "numberOfAyahs": 30,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 29,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 594,
      "ruku": 531,
      "hizbQuarter": 237,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6023,
      "text": "and enter My Paradise.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 89,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الفَجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Fajr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Dawn",
        "numberOfAyahs": 30,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 30,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 594,
      "ruku": 531,
      "hizbQuarter": 237,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6024,
      "text": "I do swear by this city [of Makkah] –",
      "surah": {
        "number": 90,
        "name": "سُورَةُ البَلَدِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Balad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The City",
        "numberOfAyahs": 20,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 1,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 594,
      "ruku": 532,
      "hizbQuarter": 238,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6025,
      "text": "and you are free of restriction [for a while] in this city[1] –",
      "surah": {
        "number": 90,
        "name": "سُورَةُ البَلَدِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Balad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The City",
        "numberOfAyahs": 20,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 2,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 594,
      "ruku": 532,
      "hizbQuarter": 238,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6026,
      "text": "and by every parent[2] and his offspring,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 90,
        "name": "سُورَةُ البَلَدِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Balad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The City",
        "numberOfAyahs": 20,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 3,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 594,
      "ruku": 532,
      "hizbQuarter": 238,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6027,
      "text": "We have created man in hardship.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 90,
        "name": "سُورَةُ البَلَدِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Balad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The City",
        "numberOfAyahs": 20,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 4,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 594,
      "ruku": 532,
      "hizbQuarter": 238,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6028,
      "text": "Does he think that none can ever have power over him?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 90,
        "name": "سُورَةُ البَلَدِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Balad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The City",
        "numberOfAyahs": 20,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 5,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 594,
      "ruku": 532,
      "hizbQuarter": 238,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6029,
      "text": "He says, “I have squandered enormous wealth!”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 90,
        "name": "سُورَةُ البَلَدِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Balad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The City",
        "numberOfAyahs": 20,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 6,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 594,
      "ruku": 532,
      "hizbQuarter": 238,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6030,
      "text": "Does he think that no one sees him?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 90,
        "name": "سُورَةُ البَلَدِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Balad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The City",
        "numberOfAyahs": 20,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 7,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 594,
      "ruku": 532,
      "hizbQuarter": 238,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6031,
      "text": "Have We not given him two eyes,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 90,
        "name": "سُورَةُ البَلَدِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Balad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The City",
        "numberOfAyahs": 20,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 8,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 594,
      "ruku": 532,
      "hizbQuarter": 238,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6032,
      "text": "and a tongue and two lips,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 90,
        "name": "سُورَةُ البَلَدِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Balad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The City",
        "numberOfAyahs": 20,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 9,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 594,
      "ruku": 532,
      "hizbQuarter": 238,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6033,
      "text": "and shown him the two ways [of right and wrong]?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 90,
        "name": "سُورَةُ البَلَدِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Balad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The City",
        "numberOfAyahs": 20,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 10,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 594,
      "ruku": 532,
      "hizbQuarter": 238,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6034,
      "text": "Yet he did not make his way through the steep path[3],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 90,
        "name": "سُورَةُ البَلَدِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Balad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The City",
        "numberOfAyahs": 20,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 11,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 594,
      "ruku": 532,
      "hizbQuarter": 238,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6035,
      "text": "and how do you know what the steep path is?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 90,
        "name": "سُورَةُ البَلَدِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Balad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The City",
        "numberOfAyahs": 20,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 12,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 594,
      "ruku": 532,
      "hizbQuarter": 238,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6036,
      "text": "It is freeing a slave,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 90,
        "name": "سُورَةُ البَلَدِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Balad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The City",
        "numberOfAyahs": 20,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 13,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 594,
      "ruku": 532,
      "hizbQuarter": 238,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6037,
      "text": "or giving food on a day of hunger,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 90,
        "name": "سُورَةُ البَلَدِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Balad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The City",
        "numberOfAyahs": 20,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 14,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 594,
      "ruku": 532,
      "hizbQuarter": 238,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6038,
      "text": "to an orphan relative,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 90,
        "name": "سُورَةُ البَلَدِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Balad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The City",
        "numberOfAyahs": 20,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 15,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 594,
      "ruku": 532,
      "hizbQuarter": 238,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6039,
      "text": "or to a needy person in misery,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 90,
        "name": "سُورَةُ البَلَدِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Balad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The City",
        "numberOfAyahs": 20,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 16,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 594,
      "ruku": 532,
      "hizbQuarter": 238,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6040,
      "text": "then [most importantly] to be one of those who believe and exhort one another to patience and exhort one another to compassion.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 90,
        "name": "سُورَةُ البَلَدِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Balad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The City",
        "numberOfAyahs": 20,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 17,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 594,
      "ruku": 532,
      "hizbQuarter": 238,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6041,
      "text": "Such are the people of the Right[4].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 90,
        "name": "سُورَةُ البَلَدِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Balad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The City",
        "numberOfAyahs": 20,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 18,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 594,
      "ruku": 532,
      "hizbQuarter": 238,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6042,
      "text": "As for those who reject Our signs, they are the people of the Left[5],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 90,
        "name": "سُورَةُ البَلَدِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Balad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The City",
        "numberOfAyahs": 20,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 19,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 594,
      "ruku": 532,
      "hizbQuarter": 238,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6043,
      "text": "who will be locked up in the Fire.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 90,
        "name": "سُورَةُ البَلَدِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Balad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The City",
        "numberOfAyahs": 20,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
